The MIT License above covers the build tooling in this repository only.

The wallpapers in backgrounds/ and the generated preview/unlock images are
Bing's image of the day, downloaded daily from Microsoft's Bing image API.
They are © Microsoft and their respective photographers/agencies, and are
intended for personal use as desktop wallpaper only. Each daily release
carries the photographer credit and source link. If you are a rights holder
and want an image removed, open an issue and the repository will be taken
down and rebuilt without it (git history is append-only, so removal means
recreating the repository).
